    Upstream:  https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro   (author: hexgrad)
    Fork used: https://github.com/semidark/kokoro

Redistributed to pin weight compatibility: the Hebrew model in this project was
trained against this fork's weight_norm parametrizations API. Upstream pip
`kokoro` (0.9.x) uses the older weight_g/weight_v naming and silently drops
decoder weights when loading these weights, producing garbled audio.
